  "bodyHash": "DsNZ8HDaPO8=",
  "content": "<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/banner.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings\">\n<img alt=\"Github\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">\n<img alt=\"透過Crowdin翻譯\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n厭倦了過於像素化、數量有限且缺乏完善選擇介面的畫作嗎？\nImmersive Paintings 讓玩家能夠透過拖放、截圖或提供網址，自行創作出 Minecraft 風格的畫作。\n無需資源包、支援多人遊玩且易於使用。\n</p>\n\n<p>本模組提供一個簡單但功能強大的圖形介面，讓您選擇自己的畫作、其他玩家的作品，或透過可選資料包提供的畫作。內建預設資料包，方便您快速上手！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/selector.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>創作選單可讓您快速將圖片像素化，並套用後製效果與抖色，讓它們無需繁瑣調整便能完美融入 Minecraft。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/editor.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>但精美的畫作怎能少了華麗的畫框？從多種風格與大量材質中挑選，讓您的藝術作品更加引人注目。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/frames.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>透過智慧型細節層級、快取與延遲資料串流技術，效能影響幾乎無法察覺。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/multi.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>也支援發光顏料喔！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/glow.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>您的圖片有透明背景？沒問題，使用塗鴉功能就能噴在任何牆面上！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/alpha.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p>以下是合成配方。</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_paintings%3A.%2A&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersivePaintings%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=48&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"自動生成配方圖片\"/></p>\n\n<p>\n相容於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/joy-of-painting\">Joy of Painting</a>！\n只需將畫布放在畫作上即可展示！\n</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/joy.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<h1>給伺服器管理員</h1>\n<p>\nImmersive Paintings 需要傳輸與儲存圖片，在伺服器上可能累積相當大量的資料。如果您的伺服器頻寬或儲存空間不足，請參考\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Config\">設定檔</a>。\n其中提供了對使用者的限制選項與頻寬調節功能，以便根據您的需求進行調整。\n</p>\n\n<h1>資料包</h1>\n<p>\n您也可以選擇透過\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Custom-Paintings\">資料包</a>\n分享畫作集。\n</p>\n\n<h1>翻譯</h1>\n<p>\n希望本模組支援您的語言？請在\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">Crowdin</a>\n協助翻譯。\n</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>Immersive Collection</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Armors&description=大量獨特且貼近原風格的護甲套裝。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Armors\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Aircraft&description=一系列鄉村風飛行器，用於旅行、運輸與探索！&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Aircraft\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Melodies&description=用各種樂器演奏自訂旋律，盡情騷擾你的朋友！&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Melodies\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Paintings&description=拖放、像素化，然後掛上美麗的藝術作品。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Paintings\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Optimization&description=輕量級實體刻排程器，讓你TPS翻倍。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Optimization\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/selectivebounds\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=在不需要時隱藏醜陋的方塊選取外框。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"SelectiveBounds\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man%20of%20Many%20Planes&description=為Immersive Aircraft設計的附加飛行器套組，包含支援Create模組。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Man of Many Planes\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-machinery\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Machinery&description=一系列鄉村風機械，用於運輸、採礦與自動化。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Machinery\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-furniture\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Furniture&description=在遊戲中自訂精美家具，或從豐富的線上圖庫中挑選。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Furniture\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-gateways\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Gateways&description=散佈於主世界的神祕遠古傳送門。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Gateways\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<h1>擴充套件</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings-faithful-addon\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful%20擴充套件&description=為Faithful設計的32像素材質包擴充套件。&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/629/725/64/64/638028066470632891.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Faithful 擴充套件\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/arids-immersive-resprites\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Arids%20Immersive%20Resprites&description=為Immersive Melodies與Immersive Paintings模組重新繪製材質！&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/common/icons/arids-immersive-resprites.webp&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Arids Immersive Resprites\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=f79ed7591f3496f8580139e47ae744c3\" alt=\"頁面雜湊值，用於更輕鬆的頁面部署。\"/>",
